0 Crossglide — offset shafts and twice-round orbit
0 Name: crossglide.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../licenses/crossglide.txt
0 // Original native arrangement. One motor on hub port A.
0 // Parallel vertical shafts offset 40 LDU; two perpendicular double-guide slides.
0 // Both eyes of each slider remain engaged throughout complete rotation.
0 // External standard part meshes are referenced, not embedded.
